  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Access in the Occupied Palestinian Territories.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Humanitarian Access programme in the OPTs will Support humanitarian access and Gaza reconstruction through funding to the United Nations Access Coordination Unit (ACU) and the Gaza Reconstruction Mechanism Project Management Unit (GRM-PMU). This project also includes a Humanitarian contingency to allow for speedy response in case of spikes in humanitarian need. Humanitarian assistance will be provided to respond to Health, Shelter, Food, WASH, cash assistance and protection needs.</narrative>
  </description>
